"Aren deserted after Barrier and is the youngest of the nine runaways at the old watchtower."
"Aren does the runaways' hauling, cooking and night fires, and is the only hill man among them."
"Aren creeps down at night for the bread left at his mother's fold gate, and ties his knot there."
"Aren told Rasid which flocks to raid, and made sure his mother's was spared."
"Aren would turn himself in to the headman if he were promised he would not hang."
"Aren fears Dov and Makram, and overheard them talk of selling captives to a coast slaver."
"Aren would try to warn a lone stranger woman away from the watchtower and its men."
